  "notes": "Buzz (Ryanair group, Poland; formerly Ryanair Sun) flies 737-800s and 737-8200s for Ryanair's network. Best side view is from 2021; a 2025 photo shows it unchanged. Belly and right side not measured. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on SP-RZA (737-8200, left, 2021-11-15), measuring between its doors on the B738 shape's door positions and placing the title by the window line: BUZZ runs x 0.158-0.342 (it had been 0.148-0.283), its letters from y ~-0.18 to just over the windows' top (height 0.9 without the black outline); by RYANAIR runs 0.043-0.086. Drawn on the 737-8200 (B38M; the measured B738 shape is 0.6 m shorter, close enough here).",
  "history": "New entry. Buzz replaced the Ryanair Sun brand in late 2019; some aircraft still fly in full Ryanair paint under the RYS code."
